# A FRU image whose common header points the product info area past the end of
# the device. Historically this class of input is where FRU parsers overrun.

@mark image
@fru/board.hex
@poke image 4 0xfe    # product info area offset = 254 * 8 = 2032, past the end
@poke image 7 0xe8    # header checksum recomputed for the line above:
                      # -(01+00+01+04+fe+14+00) mod 256 = 0xe8
